    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/44/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [
    {
      "effect": "Tenu: Permet à Diancie de Méga-Évoluer en Méga-Diancie.",
      "short_effect": "Tenu: Permet à Diancie de Méga-Évoluer en Méga-Diancie.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "effect": "Held: Allows Diancie to Mega Evolve into Mega Diancie.",
      "short_effect": "Held: Allows Diancie to Mega Evolve into Mega Diancie.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ディアンシーに　もたせておくと\nたたかいのとき　メガシンカが　できる\nふしぎな　メガストーンの　いっしゅ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "디안시에게 지니게 하면\n배틀할 때 메가진화할 수 있는\n신비한 메가스톤의 일종.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "讓蒂安希攜帶後，\n在戰鬥時就能進行超級進化的\n一種神奇超級石。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une variété de Méga-Gemme.\nTenue par un Diancie, elle lui permet de\nméga-évoluer durant un combat.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Einer der mysteriösen Mega-Steine. Wird er von\neinem Diancie getragen, kann es im Kampf eine\nMega-Entwicklung durchführen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una de las misteriosas Megapiedras. Permite\nmegaevolucionar a Diancie en combate.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una delle misteriose Megapietre.\nData a Diancie, gli permette di megaevolversi\ndurante la lotta.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "One of a variety of mysterious Mega Stones.\nHave Diancie hold it, and this stone will enable it\nto Mega Evolve during battle.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ディアンシーに　持たせておくと\n戦いのとき　メガシンカが　できる\n不思議な　メガストーンの　一種。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "让蒂安希携带后，\n在战斗时就能进行超级进化的\n一种神奇超级石。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
